If each function approaches 2 as its respective variable approaches 1, find \( x \) such that \( f(g(h(x))) \rightarrow 2a \) as \( x \rightarrow 1 \). Additionally, determine how many positive real solutions exist for the equation \( \log_2(2k + ak^2) = x \), for any given constant \( a > 0 \).

